sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant H as Web host
    participant R as Agent Runner
    participant P as PostgreSQL

    B->>H: POST /forge/v1/dispatch<br/>Forge-Destination: ide.chat.history.list
    H->>H: Check session, origin and CSRF
    H->>R: POST /v1/dispatch<br/>Bearer + same destination<br/>ChatHistoryListRequest
    R->>P: ChatHistoryDao read transaction<br/>List admitted, available chat summaries
    P-->>R: Summaries and page cursor
    R-->>H: chat_history_listed
    H-->>B: 200 · render Previous chats

    B->>H: POST /forge/v1/dispatch<br/>Forge-Destination: ide.chat.history.open<br/>Chat ID in ChatHistoryOpenRequest
    H->>H: Check session, origin and CSRF
    H->>R: POST /v1/dispatch<br/>Bearer + same destination<br/>ChatHistoryOpenRequest
    R->>P: ChatHistoryDao read transaction<br/>Open the admitted chat ID
    P-->>R: Transcript, retention and revision, or missing
    alt Chat is available
        R-->>H: chat_history_opened
        H-->>B: 200 · render the stored transcript
    else Missing, expired or deleted
        R-->>H: 404 · chat unavailable
        H-->>B: Keep menu available and refresh the list
    end
